      "content": "That analogy about the story ending illustrates a deep sense of finality and hopelessness you are experiencing. When everything feels concluded, professional support can sometimes help shift the perspective from finality to transition, even if small changes. Please consider using a crisis line, as they offer immediate, non-judgmental space to talk through these powerful feelings of closure. You deserve support in finding a new direction, even when the old path feels entirely finished.",
      "source": "target",
